              <Culture>en-US</Culture>
              <Text>This block calls the FB CallUnit which includes all further functionality of the unit.
It reads the general global status and the safety status from the respective safety zone.
It writes the unit status back to the DB Global.Data and the acknowledge information to the respetive safety zone.
OB Main is a program cycle OB and is called depending on its number. For details, refer to the Automation Framework documentation.</Text>
